Provenance
----------
The 12 operator modules in this repository were written to specifications
provided by the copyright holder, with implementation assistance from Google
Gemini. Adapted copies of some of these modules are maintained in the
hetero-moe research repository
(https://github.com/Microbiosis/hetero-moe) under
research/aligner/v62_dimension_projection_space/ and are distributed under
the same license.

Scope of this repository
------------------------
Everything under hybrid_moa_vl_operator_suite/ is byte-identical to the
shipped archive, including the import fixes it carries (if __package__:
dual-mode imports, and the persistent sparse top-k megakernel exposed under
both persistent_moa_norm_sparse_topk_megakernel and
persistent_norm_sparse_topk_agg_kernel in every environment).

The only files written for this repository are smoke_test.py, README.md,
NOTICE and .gitignore; they are covered by the LICENSE file below.

Per-module license headers were deliberately not inserted, so the operator
files stay byte-identical to the shipped archive.

